messages[14]{user,text}:
  user_1,Hi is this ProtectAll Agency
  user_2,Ah yes this is Vikram from ProtectAll Agency How can I assist you today
  user_1,I'm Kavya Iyer I have a travel policy with DCoders and I'm trying to understand the status of my policy
  user_2,Okay Kavya can you please provide me with your policy number so I can look into this for you
  user_1,It's TP-001234
  user_2,Thank you Kavya [typing] Ah I see that your policy is currently showing as expired
  user_1,Expired What do you mean It was supposed to be active until the end of the month
  user_2,I apologize for the confusion Kavya Let me see what happened [pause] Ah I see that there was an issue with the payment processing
  user_1,But I'm sure I paid the premium on time
  user_2,I understand Kavya Let me put you on hold for just a minute while I look into this further [hold music starts]
  user_1,[sighs] Okay
  user_2,[hold music ends] Kavya I apologize for the delay I've checked on the payment and it seems that there was an error on our end
  user_1,So what does this mean for my policy
  user_2,We can reinstate your policy but you'll need to pay the premium again and we'll also need to update your payment information to avoid any future issues